  "title": "Oh, what a Friend",
  "lyrics": [
    "Verse 1:",
    "Oh, what a Friend",
    "Who walks beside me",
    "To hold my hand,",
    "And safely guide me.",
    "Safe in His arms,",
    "He'll always hide me.",
    "Oh, what a Friend, He is to me.",
    "",
    "Verse 2:",
    "He knows the way,",
    "My road is wending.",
    "He sees around",
    "My pathway's bending.",
    "He'll take me through",
    "When day is ending.",
    "Oh, what a Friend, he is to me."
  ],
